## Test-only tokenizer vocabularies

`core/rag`'s `app.skein.core.rag.tokenizers` package implements WordPiece and
Unigram itself (no third-party tokenizer library ships in any variant). Its JVM
unit tests are pinned against the real `tokenizer.json` vocabularies, which are
vendored under `core/rag/src/test/resources/tokenizers/` in gzipped form. These
are **test resources only** — nothing below is packaged into the APK.

Each file's Hugging Face repository, revision, SHA-256 and license is recorded
in `core/rag/src/test/resources/tokenizers/MANIFEST.md`, and
`tools/tokenizers/fetch_tokenizers.sh` re-derives every hash.

### nomic-embed-text-v1.5 tokenizer

- **SPDX:** `Apache-2.0`
- **Repository:** https://huggingface.co/nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5
- **File:** `tokenizer.json` (BERT-uncased WordPiece vocabulary)
- **Attribution:** Copyright (c) Nomic AI.

### ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2 tokenizer

- **SPDX:** `Apache-2.0`
- **Repository:** https://huggingface.co/cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2
- **File:** `tokenizer.json` (BERT-uncased WordPiece vocabulary)
- **Attribution:** Copyright (c) Ubiquitous Knowledge Processing Lab (UKP-TUDA)
  / the Sentence-Transformers authors.

### gliner_small-v2.5 (DeBERTa-v3) tokenizer

- **SPDX:** `Apache-2.0`
- **Repository:** https://huggingface.co/GG-QandV/gliner_small-v2.5-onnx
  (base model https://huggingface.co/gliner-community/gliner_small-v2.5)
- **File:** `tokenizer.json` (SentencePiece Unigram vocabulary)
- **Attribution:** Copyright (c) the GLiNER authors.

### Golden fixtures

`core/rag/src/test/resources/tokenizers/golden/*.golden.json` are generated
output produced by running Python `tokenizers` 0.22.1
(https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers, Apache-2.0, © Hugging Face) over the
vocabularies above. No `tokenizers` code is vendored, linked or shipped — only
its output is recorded, to prove the Kotlin reimplementation agrees with it.

